// The Setup stepper (first boot) and the one-time-code pages that give an
// admin a password and an authenticator: the first admin (the console's
// setup code), an invited admin (the code an owner gets from AddAdmin) and
// the console's Recover access (a new password and authenticator for an
// owner, or a new owner).
//
// The stepper's six steps: 1 the setup code (RedeemCode), 2 the first
// admin (CheckPassword, BeginCredentials, CompleteCredentials), 3 the
// recovery keys, 4 the network (optional), 5 the protection (read only),
// 6 signing in once (SignInService.SignIn) and Finish.

